# Base origin of the backend API (no trailing slash).
#
# Deployed Hostinger backend:
VITE_API_URL=https://rosybrown-snake-826018.hostingersite.com
#
# Local development:
#   VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000
#
# If the backend later moves to a custom domain, just change this one value
# in Vercel -> Project Settings -> Environment Variables and redeploy.
# The fallback in the source is http://localhost:5000, so this variable is
# what switches the app to production.